model f
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "made up"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place kasa: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input d1: date

input lawd: date

input amt: money PLN

move pay: transfers
  at lawd
  on d1
  leg cash from world to kasa amount amt

ask q: explain pay

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 5.00 PLN "the card"
  d1 = 2026-02-01 "the card"
